<translate>
==== AimingPerkRangeModifier ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Parameter for weapons. A modifier that determines how much the Aim skill affects the maximum firing range.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
AimingPerkRangeModifier = 1.5,
</syntaxhighlight>
